[[File:Honda Shigetsuma.png|thumb|right|200px|upright|Honda Shigetsuma was appointed on 25 August 2021 as the Prime Minister of Okaiken.]]

This is a list of '''[[Prime Minister of Okaiken|Prime Ministers]] of [[Okaiken]]''', including those of the [[Empire of Mitoyagi]], from when the first Sanese prime minister (in the modern sense), [[Juichi Miyazaki]], took office in 1872, until the present day. The office is currently held by [[Honda Shigetsuma]] from the [[Progressive Party of Okaiken]].

Multiple terms in office, consecutive or otherwise, are listed and counted in the first column (''administration number'') and the second column counts individuals. For example, [[Toshiro Kurosawa]], is listed as the 53rd individual to hold the office of prime minister, whilst his first cabinet is the 78th since [[Juichi Miyazaki]].

The Prime Ministers under the [[Saito Constitution|Mitoyagi Constitution]] had a [[wikipedia:mandate (politics)|mandate]] from the [[Emperor of Okaiken|Emperor]]. The "electoral mandates" shown are for the lower house of the Imperial Diet that was not constitutionally guaranteed to have any influence on the appointment of the Prime Minister.

